Z||000003||Wolfhound||09-20-2001||11:08 AM||||B52,s are incredible aircraft. All wheels are steerable and powered by electric motors for ground staging. They can literally be moved sideways. they are structurally designed for the air and the skin on the fuselage wrinkles when at rest. The wings have a protective wheel at the tip to keep them from dragging the ground during takeoff and landing.<BR> ||||reg||1
